# NXP RTD Config-Tools-generated PB configurations (board-specific *_PBcfg.c
# / *_Cfg.h files generated by S32 Design Studio S32CT from .mex). These
# carry the NXP Confidential and Proprietary licence header and must not be
# checked into a public repository. Each developer regenerates them locally
# from the .mex against their own S32_RTD_PATH / FREERTOS_PATH / LWIP_PATH.
# See actuation_module/freertos_s32z2/README.md for the workflow.
actuation_module/freertos_s32z2/generated/

